    {
      "description": "Active connections over the pool's maximum, per job. It is computed from the metrics the API already publishes (a single hikaricp_* series set today, pool HikariPool-1); an empty panel means the datasource metrics stopped being exported, not that the pool is idle. The 0.8 line is the starting threshold written down in decision D4 -- a number to adjust, not a service-level objective.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
